Exact source archive URL and SHA-256: leaflet-compat/upstream.json.

Local changes include TeaVM source adaptation, explicit callback removal,
correct native namespaces, keyboard option assignment, primitive numeric native
boundaries, modern Leaflet API bindings, custom markers, SVG/video overlays,
animated navigation, runtime resource loading, formatting, and a Leaflet 1.9.4 showcase. This is an independent fork.
